title: "kuro-jikken: when do LLM agents get computational chemistry wrong?"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible benchmark and tool suite comparing LLM-only, tool-augmented,
  and tool-plus-verification modes on basic molecular property questions for
  benign small molecules.
